---
// Process.astro — Artisanal 4-Step Craftsmanship
// Zero factory shortcuts — 100% kadhai transparency
---

<section class="process-section" id="process">
  <div class="process-inner">
    <div class="process-header">
      <div class="sec-tag"><span>✦</span> The Artisanal Way</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">No Factory. <em>Just Craft.</em></h2>
      <p class="process-promise">
        "The day we rush the process is the day the taste changes. We would rather make less than make it wrong."
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-steps" id="proc-steps">
      <div class="process-line"><div class="process-line-fill" id="proc-line"></div></div>

      <div class="process-step" data-step>
        <div class="step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="m10 15 5-3-5-3v6Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Source Ingredients</h3>
        <p class="step-body">Grade-A dal, whole heritage spices, and pure yellow mustard oil.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-step" data-step>
        <div class="step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Prepare the Batch</h3>
        <p class="step-body">Master halwais handcraft small 15–20kg batches in heavy iron kadhais. Never automated assembly lines, never rushed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-step" data-step>
        <div class="step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Taste &amp; Quality Check</h3>
        <p class="step-body">Every single batch is crunch-tested and tasted before packing. If it doesn't meet our heritage benchmark, it never leaves the kitchen.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-step" data-step>
        <div class="step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">04</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Pack &amp; Dispatch</h3>
        <p class="step-body">Packed fresh in our Muzaffarnagar kitchen and sent straight to your door.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
